<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ernest Adams first half profit shrinks.</title>
<headline>Ernest Adams first half profit shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  0.37 vs 0.93</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  4.5 vs 11.3</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  2.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				   27.36 vs 25.54</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     0.55 vs 1.40</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.18 vs 0.47</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 16.27 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries 0.99 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Jan 24</p>
<p>Reg date Jan 10</p>
<p>    Ex div   Jan 13</p>
<p>Note - Ernest Adams Ltd is a cake maker. The company listed after tax reconstruction costs of NZ$0.39 million as an extraordinary item. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
